Happily it isn't often that object structures change, but new-style class 
objects do change non-compatibly between 2.3 and 2.4. It will mean (when 
we know the extent of the impacts) telling users 1) to re-install all 
packages depending on the methods package when 2.4 comes out, and 
crucially 2) not to rely on being able to read data objects from 2.3 and 
earlier in 2.4 and later.

